<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Erreur serveur</title>
    <style>
      body {
        background: #1a1a1a;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        height: 100vh;
        margin: 0;
      }
      .error {
        font-size: 7rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 1rem;
        color: #ffb300;
        text-shadow: 0 0 20px #ffb300, 0 0 40px #ffb30044;
        animation: shake 0.7s infinite alternate;
      }
      @keyframes shake {
        0% {
          transform: rotate(-3deg) scale(1.05);
        }
        100% {
          transform: rotate(3deg) scale(1.1);
        }
      }
      .message {
        font-size: 2rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
        text-align: center;
        color: #eee;
        animation: fadeIn 2s;
      }
      @keyframes fadeIn {
        from {
          opacity: 0;
        }
        to {
          opacity: 1;
        }
      }
      .back {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding: 0.7rem 2rem;
        background: #ffb300;
        color: #222;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 30px;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: background 0.2s;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #0005;
      }
      .back:hover {
        background: #ff8800;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="error">500</div>
    <div class="message">
      Oups ! Une erreur serveur est survenue.<br />On revient à l'accueil ?
    </div>
    <button class="back" onclick="window.location.href='/users'">
      Liste des users
    </button>
  </body>
</html>
